&lt;li&gt;Must be a U.S. Citizen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Secret security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target Education: High school diploma or high school equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
