&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Work Location; Primary&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;Philadelphia, PA; periodic travel to customer and operational sites may be required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
