&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve technology maturation, production scalability, and industrial adoption. Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and maintain collaborative relationships across&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OUSD(R&amp;amp;E) o Manufacturing Innovation Institutes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Military Departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defense Agencies&lt;/li&gt;
