&lt;li&gt;Coordinate technical reviews and facilitate working groups focused on manufacturing innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with workforce development initiatives supporting the Manufacturing Innovation Institutes.&lt;/li&gt;
