&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office Location: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Wright-Patterson Air Force Base&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities and/or Success Factors:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support acquisition and procurement activities for products, services, organizational IT systems, and other Directorate requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze business and purchasing processes and recommend improvements that increase efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyze acquisition and purchasing data and assist in developing standardized business rules and enterprise solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct cost analysis, financial planning, budgeting, and acquisition-order coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform market research and prepare, analyze, and review procurement documentation and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support requests for quotations based on Government requirements and coordinate with vendors to clarify requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate vendor offers and acquisition vehicles to support identification of advantageous solutions for the Government.&lt;/li&gt;
