&lt;li&gt;3-7 years&#39; Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in business analysis, program support, operations analysis, or related work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform requirements and process analysis using established methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
