&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Manage and maintain DoDAAC/DoDAAD records, including researching, validating, reconciling, and processing activations, modifications, transfers, and inactivations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Research complex logistics and DoDAAC issues, identify root causes, evaluate available information, and develop practical, sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Analyze logistics data to identify trends, discrepancies, process gaps, and opportunities to improve efficiency, data integrity, and customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Manage and track ETMS2 taskers, ensuring actions are accurately assigned, monitored, coordinated, and completed within established deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain tasker trackers, status reports, dashboards, metrics, and leadership briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Utilize Power BI and Microsoft Excel to analyze logistics data and develop dashboards, reports, and visualizations that support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Develop, review, edit, and maintain SOPs, internal guidance, process documentation, job aids, and other logistics-related materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Research changes to U.S. Marine Corps and DoD policies, regulations, instructions, and procedures and assist with updating organizational processes and guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Translate complex policies and requirements into clear, practical procedures for personnel at various organizational levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Develop and deliver training and informational briefings, including presentations to large groups, on logistics processes, policies, systems, and organizational procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Support property accountability, inventory management, asset lifecycle management, and logistics data reconciliation as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Research and resolve discrepancies involving DoDAACs, logistics records, inventory data, serial numbers, NIINs, NSNs, and supporting documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Marine Corps commands, supply personnel, program offices, DLA, property personnel, and other stakeholders to resolve logistics issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Identify and recommend process improvements and workflow efficiencies that improve data integrity, operational effectiveness, and customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Prepare written products, presentations, reports, briefings, and other materials for government and organizational leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Manage multiple priorities and independently execute assigned projects and actions while meeting established deadlines. Training &amp;amp; Knowledge Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Develop and deliver training on logistics processes, systems, policies, procedures, and organizational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Present training and briefings to large groups and diverse audiences, including government and contractor personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Develop presentations, training materials, job aids, and reference guides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Assess training needs and recommend improvements to increase user understanding, consistency, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_editor-paragraph&quot;&gt;Serve as a knowledgeable resource for personnel requiring assistance with logistics processes and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Thinking&lt;/li&gt;
