&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Arlo Solutions (Arlo) is an information technology consulting services company that specializes in delivering technology solutions. Our reputation reflects the high quality of the talented Arlo Solutions team and the consultants working in partnership with our customers. Our mission is to understand and meet the needs of both our customers and consultants by delivering quality, value-added solutions. Our solutions are designed and managed to not only reduce costs, but to improve business processes, accelerate response time, improve services to end-users, and give our customers a competitive edge, now and into the future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description: &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Arlo Solutions provides Executive Administrative, Administrative, and Project Management Support Services to the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services (HHS), Assistant Secretary for Financial Resources (ASFR), Office of Acquisitions (OA). The work supports three Senior Executives with calendaring, correspondence, meeting coordination, and travel logistics, while also providing SharePoint site management, procurement package tracking, and administrative support for 5–8 OA meetings and conferences monthly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;(Onsite) Washington, D.C.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities and/or Success Factors:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Calendaring &amp;amp; Meeting Organization: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
